graph LR
    subgraph Network Layer
        Transport[transport.rs]
        Discovery[discovery.rs]
    end

    subgraph Validation Layer
        Validation[validation.rs]
        Crypto[identity.rs]
        Replay[replay.rs]
    end

    subgraph Core Routing
        Mesh[mesh.rs]
        Storage[storage.rs]
    end

    subgraph Consensus Layer
        Consensus[integration.rs]
        AEDA[aeda.rs]
        Reputation[node.rs]
    end

    subgraph Observability
        Metrics[metrics.rs]
    end

    %% Message Flow
    Transport -->|Inbound TCP| Validation
    Validation -->|Signature Check| Crypto
    Crypto -->|Min Seq Check| Replay
    Replay -->|Valid Message| Storage
    Storage -->|New State| Consensus
    Consensus -->|Median Calculation| AEDA
    AEDA -->|Escalate| Metrics

    %% Byzantine Feedback Loop
    Consensus -.->|Anomaly Detected| Reputation
    Reputation -.->|Penalty Applied| Consensus
